flowchart TD
    Start["Capture initial_head_sha at clean cycle start or verify same-workflow continuation"] --> State["Typed root snapshot, initial_head_sha, ordered entries/check IDs, stack number, round<br/>Preserve initial baseline through landing; never infer from logs"]
    State --> Context["Feature PR targets main OUTSIDE native stack<br/>Candidate is feature initially, top repair while pending"]
    Context --> Checks["Full current-candidate validation<br/>Compilation, metadata, lint, build, then tests/security/docs"]
    Checks --> Labels["Add candidate failure labels on feature<br/>Clear ONLY passing actual current-parent checks"]
    Checks --> Green{"All candidate gates green?"}
    Green -->|No| Budget{"Below 6 repair calls total including metadata?<br/>Valid evidence, no unknown bot repairs or changed snapshots?"}
    Budget -->|No| Stop["Stop explicitly; manual handling<br/>Preserve stacks and branches; no unstack/recreate/rebase/force-push"]
    Budget -->|Yes| Select["Native needs gate result failure selects repair; workflow_call<br/>Consume one durable call; labels are not triggers"]
    Select -->|Metadata| Metadata["Update root title/body only; explicit audit comment<br/>Verify real change and unchanged code/baseline; no fake file PR"]
    Metadata --> Save["Persist verified transition and round for next attempt"]
    Select -->|"ALL file repairs including lint"| Publish["Agent publishes next separate repair PR only; no direct feature push<br/>First base: feature; later base: preceding repair branch"]
    Publish --> Inspect["Validator verifies bot/native identity and all snapshots<br/>Expected membership/order/trunk, protected paths, bounded scope"]
    Inspect --> Scoped["Selected gate plus previously green project gates<br/>Inherited red/unexecuted gates remain unresolved"]
    Scoped -->|Required checks pass| Register["Controller pr-register-repair-stack.yml<br/>Ordinary at 1; register real native stack at 2; append later"]
    Register --> NoMerge["Read back all native membership/order/trunk<br/>Do NOT merge after scoped success"]
    NoMerge --> Save
    Save --> Dispatch["Bounded explicit dispatch of next exact revision"]
    Dispatch --> State

    Green -->|Yes| Pending{"Unmerged repairs?"}
    Pending -->|Yes| Guard["Controller pr-land-repair-stack.yml pins top SHA<br/>Verify every root/member snapshot, check, order, stack number, feature trunk"]
    Guard --> Rules["Enforce feature rules on every member<br/>Intermediate layers may block; never weaken rules; queues blocked"]
    Rules --> Land["Guarded native asynchronous squash landing into feature only<br/>Entire stack atomic ascending; single ordinary repair uses same API"]
    Land --> Poll["Bounded poll; confirm EACH repair merged and squash SHA<br/>Verify actual feature head and landing history"]
    Poll --> Audit["Feature comment links initial_head_sha, baseline-to-final compare, EACH PR and squash SHA<br/>Distinguish original vs automated additions; retain baseline, branches, round"]
    Audit --> Parent["Record verified landed transition<br/>Rerun compilation and ALL parent gates at actual updated feature head"]
    Parent --> State
    Pending -->|No| Ready["PR Quality / Ready for review<br/>Actual-parent results and live snapshot only; no unmerged candidate certification"]
    Ready --> Review["Fresh human approval plus required readiness before main<br/>No queue or rule bypass"]

    State & Inspect & Scoped & Register & Guard & Rules & Poll & Audit -->|"Missing state/evidence, changed snapshot, conflict, scope, API/poll failure"| Stop
    External["Human edit or partial external landing"] --> Stop
